  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:ebc71fc6-c27c-4f78-abc9-b93b84681a56-42\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-82\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7d96c723-d23d-4543-a2b0-cd183898b820\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"551\">De <strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"85\">Apple iPad (2022)</strong> is een moderne, snelle en veelzijdige tablet die perfect is voor studie, werk, entertainment en creatief gebruik. Dankzij het heldere 10.9-inch Liquid Retina-display, de krachtige A14-processor en LTE-ondersteuning kun je overal snel en soepel werken.<br data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"340\">Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"384\">In Nette Staat</strong>: lichte gebruikssporen aan behuizing, maar technisch volledig getest en 100% functioneel. Standaard wordt een <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"516\">lader meegeleverd</strong>, zodat je direct aan de slag kunt.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"583\">⭐ Belangrijkste Pluspunten</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<li data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<p data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"625\">📱 Helder 10.9\" Liquid Retina-display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"673\">⚡ Krachtige A14-chip voor snelle prestaties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"723\">🌐 LTE-ondersteuning om overal online te zijn</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"768\">🖊️ Geschikt voor Apple Pencil (1e gen.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"809\">🔋 In Nette Staat en volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"831\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1308\">Model: <strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"860\">Apple iPad (2022)</strong><br data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"863\">Opslagcapaciteit: <strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"889\">64GB</strong><br data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"892\">Kleur: <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"918\">Zilver (Silver)</strong><br data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"921\">Scherm: <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"952\">10.9\" Liquid Retina</strong><br data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"955\">Resolutie: <strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"981\">2360 × 1640</strong><br data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"984\">Processor: <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1024\">Apple A14 Bionic – 3.1GHz</strong><br data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1027\">RAM: <strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1055\">Niet gespecificeerd</strong><br data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1058\">Batterijcapaciteit: <strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1126\">Ongeveer 7.600 mAh (typisch voor 2022-model)</strong><br data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\">Connectiviteit: <strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1176\">LTE, WiFi, Bluetooth, USB-C</strong><br data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\">Meegeleverde accessoires: <strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1214\">Lader</strong><br data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1217\">Schermconditie: <strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1280\">Krasvrij of licht gebruikt (In Nette Staat)</strong><br data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1283\">Staat: <strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1308\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1341\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1341\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><em data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1339\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden</em></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>",
